  npcName: Vaness
  lines:
  - english: I hope you're ready for your first hunting lesson in Spirimonz.
    french: "J'esp\xE8re que tu es pr\xEAt \xE0 ta premi\xE8re le\xE7on de chasse
      de Spirimonz."
  - english: Let's take it one step at a time. First, you'll need to learn how to
      interact with your surroundings...
    french: "On va y aller \xE9tape par \xE9tape. D'abord, tu devras savoir int\xE9ragir
      avec ton environnement..."
  - english: Try turning on at least 3 different lights at the same time!
    french: "Essais d'allumer au moins 3 lumi\xE8res diff\xE9rentes en simultan\xE9
      !"
